  "description": "These clamp forks, with a 2500 lb load capacity, easily attach to your tractor bucket to quickly handle debris like root balls, logs, and stumps. Built with high-quality materials and excellent welding for enhanced durability.\nFitment\nUsed widely in farms, factories, and warehouses for highly efficient mechanical loading/unloading, stacking, and short-distance transportation, the pallet fork easily handles palletized loads.\nFeatures\nHeavy Duty\nMaterial: Surface of the product is sprayed with plastic to effectively\nplace the product rust vcorrosion. This clamp on debris forks is made of\nhigh-quality materials and has good load-bearing performance, which has\nmax load capacity up to 2500 lbs.\nEasy Installation: Simply slide the debris forks over the edge of the\nbucket and clamp it down to lock. With the capability to hauling logs,\nlumber, and firewood and move fence posts, hay bales, clear debris and\nso on.\nUsage Scenarios: The 42\" bucket debris forks are used widely in farms,\nfactories, and warehouses for good mechanical loading / unloading,\nstacking, and short distance transportation, the pallet forks easily\nhandles palletized loads.\nItem Specifications: The overall size of the tractor debris forks is\n31\" (L) x 42\" (W). With a weight of approximately 83 lbs, and 5 fork\ntines measure 21\" (L) x 2\" (W) x 2\" (H), it fits 42\" bucket or bigger\nsize bucket.\nFitment Reference: YITAMOTOR clamp on debris forks compatible with 42\"\nor bigger size tractor bucket. Buckets less than 2 inches thick are good\nfor this product.\nOne year warranty",
